<section>
  <h2>Guards for Kali Puja, Durga Puja and community functions</h2>
  <p>Barasat and Madhyamgram committees can request pandal guards for visitor-entry duties, committee access checks and overnight posts. We accept enquiries for Kali Puja, Durga Puja, Saraswati Puja, Lakshmi Puja and other agreed community or family programmes.</p>
  <p>Request a single shift or 1, 2, 3, 4 or a few days of guarding. Include setup and pack-down cover separately if needed. Peak visiting hours, night duty and quieter daytime periods may require different rosters.</p>
</section>
<section>
  <h2>Prepare a pandal-specific security brief</h2>
  <ul><li>Mark visitor entrances and exits, queue routes and any separate vendor access.</li><li>Identify committee-only rooms or storage areas and the people authorised to enter.</li><li>Provide public visiting hours, busiest programme times and a day-by-day duty schedule.</li><li>Nominate the committee contact and agree guard reporting, supervisor escalation and handovers.</li><li>For overnight guarding, state which area remains under guard and when the next shift takes over.</li></ul>
  <p>For grounds around Nabapally, Hridaypur, Madhyamgram, New Barrackpore, Sodepur or Salt Lake, send the exact pandal entrance pin. A club or park name alone may cover several entrances or a large site.</p>
</section>
<section>
  <h2>Ground access and organiser coordination</h2>
  <p>The <a href="/services/banquet-event-security-barasat-kolkata/">regional venue guide</a> includes public ground and pandal map references, while the <a href="https://www.kalipujabarasat.in/dashboards/guidemap" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Barasat Police District puja guide</a> can help organisers identify listed pandals. Confirm the current programme and authorised use with the committee.</p>
  <p>Private guards follow the agreed brief. Police permissions, procession or public-road arrangements, fire safety, electrical checks and the committee's overall crowd plan remain separate responsibilities.</p>
</section>
<section lang="bn"><h2>বারাসাত শাখা থেকে অস্থায়ী নিরাপত্তার বিষয়ে যোগাযোগ</h2><p>বারাসাত ও মধ্যমগ্রামসহ আশেপাশে কালীপুজো, দুর্গাপুজো বা অন্য পুজোর প্যান্ডেলে গার্ডের জন্য যোগাযোগ করুন। দর্শনার্থীর প্রবেশপথ, কমিটির যোগাযোগ, রাতের পাহারা এবং প্রতিদিনের ডিউটির সময় জানান। মাঠ বা পার্কের নামের সঙ্গে প্যান্ডেলের প্রকৃত প্রবেশপথের ম্যাপ পিন দিন।</p></section>

